"P218763391" "Now that you know where the girdle is all you have to do is help a Villain, Rogue, or Loyalist break into the Arachnos compound and take it back.<A HREF={ACCEPT}> Retrieve the girdle of Aphrodite for Eros.</A>"
// AcceptString :
